{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123062","id":4408057808,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBr2f0A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123062","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123062.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123062.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123062","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123062/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123062/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123062/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/89774d611975cec8a67bf0b7b55d1b39b100b4a8","number":123062,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Web, 3.x] Don't focus IME div when Virtual Keyboard is available","user":{"login":"DonutLorde","id":143850539,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJL8Kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143850539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde","html_url":"https://github.com/DonutLorde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DonutLorde/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #103387\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWhile the backport of IME from 4.x to 3.x is mostly identical, 3.x does not run the check for `!DisplayServer::get_singleton()->has_feature(DisplayServerEnums::FEATURE_IME)` in line_edit.cpp or text_edit.cpp before invoking either `set_ime_active` or `set_ime_position`. On `DisplayServerWeb`'s implementation of `has_feature`, this only returns true if virtual keyboard support is not available.  This has the unfortunate effect having the `<div class=\"ime\">` take focus away from the `<input>` on Mobile Web while using a LineEdit or TextEdit, causing various levels of input being missed depending of your mobile browser.\r\n\r\nThis PR essentially bakes the FEATURE_IME check from 4.x into `OS_JavaScript::set_ime_active` and `OS_JavaScript::set_ime_position`, resulting in the same behavior as 4.x.\r\n\r\nTested on Android Firefox 154.0.1 and Android Chrome 151.0.7922.137 on a basic scene with only a line edit, and all inputs were able to be captured, including backspace.\r\n\r\nTested on Desktop Firefox 154.0.1 as working with regular keyboard input with the same scene setup. I have not tested IME with my changes, but in theory this should give equal behavior to 4.x.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":7806203,"node_id":"M